  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Colorblindness affects millions of people worldwide, changing how they
    experience everyday life, from reading signs and distinguishing colors to playing
    games designed without accessibility in mind.

    

    This game was created
    to raise awareness of color vision deficiency through a cooperative gameplay
    experience where the characters perceive the world differently from the other.
    Through play, we hope to encourage understanding, empathy, and more accessible
    design choices in games and everyday life. Not everyone sees the world the same
    way.


    You are playing as two colorblind people, who have gotten themselves
    trapped in a dungeon. You must make them work together by standing on buttons
    that unlocks things for the other character. Look out for shapes and their amount,
    you gotta put in the correct order at the exit to escape.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 926a8b22b54a6ee4fb294e7bbc60ee3b, type: 2}
